# Witness: a wrong trimmed image size in each recognised phrasing

One sentence per recognised phrasing, each carrying its own number. The trimmed half is the
half with no anti-deletion guard behind it in the first attempt, so a rewording that escaped
the phrasing list escaped the rule entirely.

- The host also publishes as a 944,444-byte trimmed binary.

- It runs as a trimmed self-contained binary, which is 955,555 bytes.

- The trimmed size is 966,666 bytes.
